  "note": "T2 chord={L-pinky-top,L-ring-home,L-pinky-bottom,L-middle-bottom}. Next: match returned letters to fixed subset of {G,L,T,Y}; remaining two ∈ rot-group {L-middle-bottom,L-pinky-bottom,R-index-home-in}."
